Combined patch (supersedes 0123 + 0124, apply this OR that pair, not both):

- RaidManager.canStart now enforces Raid Charter / Heroic Clearance /
  Mythic Clearance server-side (previously UI-only in RaidsPanel).
- Board Warden audited: base 1 freeze/day floor confirmed intentional.
- Treasury maxLevel 12 -> 20 (storage keeps scaling); new
  GuildDef.modsMaxLevel caps its gold% bonus at the old level-12
  ceiling.
- Library xpPerLevel 12 -> 6, Runic Insight xpPerLevel 15 -> 8.
- Scholar's Legacy xpPerLevel 20 -> 10, Legacy of Wealth
  goldPerLevel 15 -> 8 (tier2MaxLevel left unchanged on both).
- Combined XP-track max across every source: 620% -> 314%.
  Combined gold-track max: 523% -> 348%.
- New ConfirmModal.tsx replaces the native window.confirm() on the
  Quest tab's Recall button.
- guild-idler-status.md updated with the full writeup.

Verified: npx tsc --noEmit and vite build both clean.
